    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "重點觀念",
      "body": [
        "單字題的四個選項意思都不一樣，要選「最搭」的那一個。",
        "很多英文的動詞和名詞是固定搭配，中文直譯會出錯。例如「訂位」是 make a reservation，不是 do a reservation。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "解題技巧",
      "body": [
        "先記住這張表："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "搭配",
          "意思",
          "例句"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "make a reservation",
            "預約、訂位",
            "I would like to make a reservation."
          ],
          [
            "meet a deadline",
            "趕上期限",
            "We need to meet the deadline."
          ],
          [
            "place an order",
            "下訂單",
            "You can place an order online."
          ],
          [
            "attend a meeting",
            "出席會議",
            "All staff must attend the meeting."
          ],
          [
            "submit an application",
            "提交申請",
            "Please submit your application."
          ],
          [
            "give a presentation",
            "做簡報",
            "She will give a presentation."
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "背單字時連搭配一起背：不要只背 deadline，要背 meet a deadline。"
